@startuml
' The five stages `npm test` runs in order; the first red stage aborts the rest.
' Colours follow the docs colour legend: green = passing/gate step, blue = build
' output, teal = editor/demo runtime.
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam noteBorderColor #B0A15A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FBF6DD

title npm test — sequential gate chain (stops at first failure)

start
:**test:types**\ntsd validates the hand-written\nTypeScript bindings (types/*.d.ts); <<#5FA55A>>
:**test:debug**\nKarma runs 516 tests against\nthe :none (debug) compile; <<#5FA55A>>
:**test:release**\nKarma runs 516 tests against\nthe :advanced (release) compile; <<#5FA55A>>
:**build:demo** (MODE=release)\nshadow-cljs release :libs\n+ copy demo assets; <<#4F86C6>>
:**test:demo**\nheadless browser loads the demo\nand asserts the Editor boots; <<#6FB2B0>>
stop

note right
  npm test is A && B && C && D && E,
  so a failing stage aborts the chain.
  Local default browser:
  ChromeHeadlessNoSandbox
  (override with KARMA_BROWSERS).
end note
@enduml
